				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-437558#post-2667616</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-437558/stare#post-2667616</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sun, 09 Oct 2016 13:38:50 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Buttfranklin</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2721810</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Wonderful story. Subtle, but deep world-building unfolds itself effortlessly, often just beneath the radar; a gripping story that's poignant without being hackneyed; the protagonists are characterised amazingly well just through dialogue, with almost no overt description - but enough crumbs are left that <em>somehow</em> I can picture them&#8230;</p> <p>Efficient, wonderfully effective writing. This is now one of my favourite tales.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
