					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I love the all the subtle (not so subtle?) references in this, the little zingers that make me go 'Oh!' out loud as I read them. And the uh&#8230;quasi-human soldiers, I loved their back-and forth. I know nothing about the University-verse, but thanks to you I want to know everything.</p> <p>My only issue was the caps. At first I was thinking 'Why the hell is everything in caps?', but now I'm wondering why isn't everything in caps. Because I want its awesome to scream at my eyeballs more.</p> <p>Beautiful writing.</p> 
				 	]]>
